      "text": "Caracteres meta:\npipe (|), ampersand (&), semicolon (;), less-than sign (<), greater-than sign (>), left\nparenthesis ((), right parenthesis ()), dollar sign ($), backquote (`), backslash (\\),\nright quote ('), double quotation marks (\")",
